# Job: node — `RawStreamSessionService.deliver()` catch-all turns every exception (incl. backpressure) into a session close (STAGE 1: diagnosis only, no code)

You are a codex sub-agent under a Claude supervisor. Read `AGENTS.md` (root) §3 (계층 소유권·금지 패턴·교차언어 대조·진단 먼저),
`framework/AGENTS.md`, and `doc/plan/c016-worklog/stage2-node-m6b-fake-stream-submit-sync-summary.md` §"Catch boundary 후속 사항".
